        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 8:07PM EDT until September 27 at 12:00PM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 25 kt with gusts up to 30 kt and
seas 9 to 14 ft.

* WHERE...The coastal waters from Cape Hatteras to Ocracoke
Inlet.

* WHEN...Until noon EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
